      "status": "completed",
      "text": "She stepped back, took a breath, and then closed her eyes as a kind of overture. Her posture and facial expression tightened and relaxed like waves, seeking a rhythm. This time her voice came out high and light, a soft smile in the sound as the words landed. She said, \"I see that you've changed the way you stand.\"\n\nHe said, \"What do you see?\"\n\nShe said, \"Your left foot is facing further out.\"\n\nHe nodded.\n\n\"You're carrying your head more to the right. I don't mean turned, I mean . . .\"\n\n\"Shifted,\" he said, his voice gentle and encouraging.\n\n\"Shifted,\" she echoed, \"yes.\"\n\nA tiny gap opened between them, and closed again as she shifted in space to make it so. This time he was the one to step forward; her shoulder tilted as he went by, a visible but unspoken answer.",
      "text_hash": "cf0e5de1fbb3f10de155740dbe7af1724173f70ecd0316b43e5eca2329cd6ea9",
